MythicOpcodeDiagnosticWindow < MainWindow
  id: mythicOpcodeDiagnostic
  text: Opcode - MythicOT
  size: 450 440
  @onEscape: self:hide()

  Label
    id: identity
    anchors.top: parent.top
    anchors.left: parent.left
    anchors.right: parent.right
    height: 18
    text-align: center

  Label
    id: instructions
    anchors.top: identity.bottom
    anchors.left: parent.left
    anchors.right: parent.right
    margin-top: 5
    height: 34
    text-wrap: true
    text: Ambos en este PC y misma clave de Navi. Rod Master: Escuchar. Sabuezo: iniciar prueba. Funciona sin WebSocket.

  Button
    id: prepare
    anchors.top: instructions.bottom
    anchors.left: parent.left
    margin-top: 7
    size: 118 24
    text: Escuchar

  ComboBox
    id: format
    anchors.top: prepare.top
    anchors.left: prepare.right
    anchors.right: parent.right
    margin-left: 7
    height: 24

  Button
    id: single
    anchors.top: prepare.bottom
    anchors.left: parent.left
    margin-top: 7
    size: 122 24
    text: Probar 201

  Button
    id: upper
    anchors.top: single.top
    anchors.left: single.right
    margin-left: 7
    size: 133 24
    text: Probar 200-255

  Button
    id: all
    anchors.top: single.top
    anchors.left: upper.right
    anchors.right: parent.right
    margin-left: 7
    height: 24
    text: Probar 8-255

  Label
    id: status
    anchors.top: single.bottom
    anchors.left: parent.left
    anchors.right: parent.right
    margin-top: 8
    height: 28
    text-wrap: true
    text-align: center
    background-color: #20282c

  Label
    id: result
    anchors.top: status.bottom
    anchors.left: parent.left
    anchors.right: parent.right
    margin-top: 10
    height: 143
    text-wrap: true
    text-align: topLeft

  Label
    id: note
    anchors.top: result.bottom
    anchors.left: parent.left
    anchors.right: parent.right
    height: 36
    text-wrap: true
    color: #d9c47b
    text: Omite callbacks ocupados. 1 intento cada 2.5 s. Los archivos locales solo coordinan; confirma por opcode.

  Button
    id: stop
    anchors.bottom: parent.bottom
    anchors.left: parent.left
    size: 125 24
    text: Detener

  Button
    id: copy
    anchors.bottom: parent.bottom
    anchors.left: stop.right
    margin-left: 7
    size: 145 24
    text: Copiar resultado

  Button
    id: close
    anchors.bottom: parent.bottom
    anchors.right: parent.right
    size: 125 24
    text: Cerrar
